        },
        {
          "text": "Aya makani oonse, ndabika moyo wangu kulingao, ndaalingula kabotu. Ndizi kuti baluleme abasongo bali mumaanza aa-Leza, amilimo yabo yoonse. Na ulabayanda, na ulibasulide, taakwe uuzi. Zyoonse zili kunembo lyabo nzyabuyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
