                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo muntu tezi ciindi cakwe na cilaba lili, Mbuli inswi mbozijatwa mubuzamba bubi, ambuli tuyuni mbotucegwa mukakole, abalo bantu balacegwa mbubonya, ciindi camapenzi naaboongomokela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.12",
